<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures erode to fresh lows.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures erode to fresh lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>Dec 27 - U.S. stock index futures eroded, with March S&amp;P 500s falling to fresh session low, moderate losses. Traders tied the pullback to local selling in otherwise light trading, with some saying locals were getting out of long positions after upside failed stalled.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
